    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">[[/attack extended]]. [[/damage average extended]]. If the target is a Humanoid not cursed by a slaad, it is subjected to the following effect.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=zy66rXdo6Mo4E9bO]]. <em>Failure:</em> The target is cursed. The cursed target can’t regain Hit Points, and its Hit Point maximum decreases by [[/r 3d6#HP Max Decrease]]{10 (3d6)} after every 24 hours and doesn’t return to normal after finishing a Long Rest.</p><p class=\"feature\">If the curse reduces the target’s Hit Point maximum to 0, the curse ends, and instead of dying, the target instantly transforms into a <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-monster-manual.actors.Actor.mmRedSlaad000000]{Red Slaad}</strong> or, if it can cast spells of level 3 or higher, a <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-monster-manual.actors.Actor.mmGreenSlaad0000]{Green Slaad}</strong>. Only a <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplWish000000]{Wish}</em> spell can reverse this transformation.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
